#: c8b980afccc54590917c2a5d822d81c5
msgid "This RC receiver comes with 6 pin output, one per each PPM channel. As Erle-Brain only accepts PPM-Sum input type, conversion from 8 PPM channel to one PPM-Sum is needed."
msgstr ""

